{'symbol': 'BLK', 'date': '2019-10-20 22:30:00', 'title': 'ARCUTIS, INC. ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS RECEIVED $94.5 MILLION IN FUNDING FROM A GROUP OF INVESTORS', 'text': 'ON OCTOBER 21, 2019, ARCUTIS, INC. CLOSED THE TRANSACTION. THE COMPANY HAS RECEIVED $94,500,000 IN ITS SERIES C ROUND OF FUNDING FROM LED BY NEW INVESTOR HBM HEALTHCARE INVESTMENTS AG (SWX:HBMN), A FUND MANAGED BY HBM PARTNERS LTD. THE TRANSACTION ALSO INCLUDED PARTICIPATION FROM NEW INVESTORS BLACKROCK, INC. (NYSE:BLK), GOLDMAN SACHS GROUP, MERCHANT BANKING DIVISION, PIVOTAL BIOVENTURE PARTNERS LLC, OMEGA FUND MANAGEMENT, LLC, AND VIVO CAPITAL, LLC AND EXISTING INVESTORS BAIN CAPITAL LIFE SCIENCES FUND, L.P., A FUND MANAGED BY BAIN CAPITAL LIFE SCIENCES INVESTORS, LLC, FRAZIER HEALTHCARE PARTNERS, ORBIMED ADVISORS LLC, AND RA CAPITAL MANAGEMENT, LLC. NEW INVESTORS INVESTED MORE THAN 50% OF INVESTMENT AND REST WAS CONTRIBUTED BY EXISTING INVESTORS. ALEXANDER ASAM OF HBM PARTNERS LTD. JOINED COMPANY’S BOARD OF DIRECTORS. THE COMPANY HAS RECEIVED MORE THAN $160,000,000 IN FUNDING DATE. THE COMPANY RECEIVED $94,499,967 FROM 16 INVESTORS PURSUANT TO EXEMPTION PROVIDED UNDER REGULATION D.'}